{{!-- META {"path":"components","title":"Components & motion","description":"Ten components you switch on with an attribute, 31 animated backgrounds, and motion written as data attributes. Each page loads only the scripts it uses, and motion steps back for visitors who ask for less.","parent":"features","order":3,"data":{"icon":"sparkle","eyebrow":"Components & motion","headline":"Interactive parts, switched on with an attribute."}} --}}
{{> page-hero parent=page.parent}}

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">Ten components</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-4 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="comp_title">Try each one live.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="max-w-md text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="comp_lead">Every card opens its showcase page, built with Sitewright like the rest of this site. The second line says what a visitor gets without JavaScript.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-12 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/carousel'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up">{{sw-icon "slideshow" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Carousel</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Fade or slide, autoplay, swipe, keyboard.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No JS: a scroll-snap row</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/lightbox'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="40">{{sw-icon "images" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Lightbox</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Full screen, thumbnails, pinch to zoom.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No JS: links to the full image</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/tabs'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="80">{{sw-icon "tabs" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Tabs</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Built from your panels, arrow keys included.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No JS: panels stacked</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/modal'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="120">{{sw-icon "app-window" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Modal</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">A native dialog: focus, Escape and backdrop from the browser.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No JS: the trigger does nothing</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/banner'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="160">{{sw-icon "megaphone" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Banner</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Dismissible, and it remembers how often to return.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No JS: stays hidden</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/forms'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up">{{sw-icon "textbox" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Form</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Generated from a form you define, with spam checks.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No JS: cannot submit, by design</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/date-picker'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="40">{{sw-icon "calendar-dots" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Date picker</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Date, range, date and time, or time.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No JS: a text field that still submits</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/animated-backgrounds'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="80">{{sw-icon "waves" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Animated background</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">31 WebGL presets in your brand colors.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No WebGL: a brand gradient</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/image-maps'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="120">{{sw-icon "map-trifold" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Image map</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Hotspots, tooltips, floors and zoom.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No JS: the plain image</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-5" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/search'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="160">{{sw-icon "magnifying-glass" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Search</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">A static index per language, no server.</p><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-base-content/50">No JS: an inert field</p></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="border-y border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/50">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr]">
    <div data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">The contract</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-4 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="contract_title">You write the markup. The runtime adds the behavior.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="contract_lead">A component is a <code class="whitespace-nowrap font-code">data-sw-component</code> marker and a few named parts. Style them with Tailwind like anything else. For tabs, the runtime builds the buttons from your panel titles and wires up the roles and the arrow keys.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost mt-6 px-0 hover:bg-transparent" href="{{sw-url '/docs/reference/components'}}">Component reference {{sw-icon "arrow-right" "h-4 w-4"}}</a>
    </div>
    <div class="ws-window overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="100">
      <div class="ws-dots flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ml-3 font-code text-xs text-white/50">pages/pricing.hbs</span></div>
<pre class="overflow-x-auto"><code><span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-component</span>=<span class="tk-str">"tabs"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-part</span>=<span class="tk-str">"panel"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-title</span>=<span class="tk-str">"Monthly"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
    …
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-part</span>=<span class="tk-str">"panel"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-title</span>=<span class="tk-str">"Yearly"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
    …
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/div&gt;</span>

<span class="tk-com">&lt;!-- Motion is attributes too --&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;section</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-scene</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;div</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-layer</span>
       <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-parallax-translate</span>=<span class="tk-str">"70,-70"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;h2</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-animation</span>=<span class="tk-str">"fade-up"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>…<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/h2&gt;</span>
  <span class="tk-tag">&lt;p</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-animation</span>=<span class="tk-str">"fade-up"</span> <span class="tk-attr">data-sw-delay</span>=<span class="tk-str">"120"</span><span class="tk-tag">&gt;</span>…<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/p&gt;</span>
<span class="tk-tag">&lt;/section&gt;</span></code></pre>
