  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-neutral text-white" data-sw-component="shader-bg" data-preset="silk-flow" data-speed="0.5" data-intensity="0.6" data-colors="neutral,primary,accent">
  <div data-sw-part="overlay" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-black/60 via-black/30 to-black/0"></div>
  <div class="ws-grid pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="ws-hero-copy relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index text-white/80">Animated backgrounds · live</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-4 text-4xl font-bold sm:text-6xl" data-sw-text="shader_title">This section is one of 31.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85" data-sw-text="shader_lead">WebGL shaders that take your brand colors, a speed, an intensity and an angle, and can follow the pointer. They pause off screen, show a still frame to visitors who prefer reduced motion, and fall back to a gradient where WebGL is missing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="100">
      {{#each (sw-split "mesh-gradient|silk-flow|plasma|caustics|lava-lamp|voronoi-cells|liquid-metal|starfield|neuro-noise" "|")}}
      <span class="rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-black/25 px-3 py-1 font-code text-xs text-white/85 backdrop-blur">{{this}}</span>
      {{/each}}
      <span class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs text-white/70">and 22 more</span>
    </div>
    <a class="btn mt-8 border-white/25 bg-black/25 text-white backdrop-blur hover:border-white/50 hover:bg-black/40" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/animated-backgrounds'}}">See all 31 {{sw-icon "arrow-right" "h-4 w-4"}}</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.15fr]">
    <div data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">Motion and effects</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-4 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="motion_title">Movement, a few attributes at a time.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="motion_lead">Write the attributes by hand, or let the builders in the editor's Library write them: the parallax builder, the button builder and the SVG animation studio, which plays the real runtimes as you adjust them.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ws-browser" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="100">
      <div class="ws-browser-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ws-browser-url">Library · SVG animation studio</span></div>
      {{> ws-media slot="feat_components_studio" class="rounded-none"}}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <a class="ws-tile rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/motion'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up">{{sw-icon "arrows-out-cardinal" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Entrance animations</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Fifteen effects (fades, zooms, slides and flips) with delay, duration, easing and a play-once switch. <code class="whitespace-nowrap font-code">sw-stagger</code> spaces out a loop.</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/parallax'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="60">{{sw-icon "stack" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Parallax</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Move, fade, scale or blur as the page scrolls, on one element or a layered scene. The editor has a parallax builder.</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/svg-animation'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="120">{{sw-icon "pen-nib" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">SVG animation</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">33 effects, from line drawing to morphing one shape into another, staged in scenes. Try them in the SVG animation studio.</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/effects'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up">{{sw-icon "cursor-click" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Nav and button effects</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">19 menu effects and 28 button effects as classes. A sticky header that pins or hides on scroll, a preloader in nine styles, scrollspy and ripples.</p></a>
    <a class="ws-tile rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" href="{{sw-url '/showcase/icons'}}" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="60">{{sw-icon "smiley" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Icons</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">1,512 Phosphor icons in six weights, 274 brand logos and 255 flags, inlined as SVG. Only the ones a site uses are published.</p></a>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-6" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="120">{{sw-icon "moon-stars" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}<h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-lg font-bold">Light and dark</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Turn themes on and <code class="whitespace-nowrap font-code">\{{sw-theme-toggle}}</code> gives visitors the switch. Their choice applies before the first paint, so the page never flashes.</p></div>
  </div>
  <a class="btn btn-ghost mt-8 px-0 hover:bg-transparent" href="{{sw-url '/docs/reference/effects'}}">Effects reference {{sw-icon "arrow-right" "h-4 w-4"}}</a>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-20 sm:pb-28">
  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="sw-border-beam rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-8 [--sw-beam-width:2px]" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      {{sw-icon "feather" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold" data-sw-text="ships_title">A page carries only what it uses.</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="ships_lead">Component scripts, animations, parallax and SVG motion load on the pages that use them and nowhere else. Only site-wide pieces, like the preloader, the sticky header or back-to-top, load on every page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 p-8" data-sw-animation="fade-up" data-sw-delay="100">
      {{sw-icon "person-simple-walk" "h-6 w-6 ws-ink"}}
      <h3 class="mt-4 font-heading text-2xl font-bold" data-sw-text="calm_title">Calm for those who ask.</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="calm_lead">When a visitor's system prefers reduced motion, entrance animations and parallax stand still, carousels stop autoplaying, animated backgrounds hold one frame and drawn SVGs appear finished. Content that animates in is visible without JavaScript too.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

